  "title": "Analysis of O(n)O(\\sqrt{n})O(n​) Complexity",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": "Course: Complexity Calculation"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 1,
      "content": "Analysis of O(n)O(\\sqrt{n})O(n​) Complexity"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Here's how the value k changed with respect to i in the last program."
    },
    {
      "type": "table",
      "rows": [
        [
          "i",
          "k"
        ],
        [
          "1",
          "1"
        ],
        [
          "2",
          "1 + 1"
        ],
        [
          "3",
          "2 + 2"
        ],
        [
          "4",
          "2 + 2 + 3"
        ],
        [
          "5",
          "2 + 2 + 3 + 4"
        ],
        [
          ".\n.",
          ".\n."
        ],
        [
          "m",
          "2 + 2 + 3 + 4 + ….. + m - 1"
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "The loop continues until k≥nk \\geq nk≥n, based on the condition in the program."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Now, let's approximate the total value of k when the loop stops:"
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "language": "text",
      "content": "k=2+2+3+4+…+(m−1)k = 2 + 2 + 3 + 4 + … + (m - 1)k=2+2+3+4+…+(m−1)"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "We approximate this to be roughly the sum of the first m natural numbers:"
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "language": "text",
      "content": "⇒k≈m(m+1)2\\Rightarrow k \\approx \\cfrac{m(m + 1)}{2}⇒k≈2m(m+1)​"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Since the program stops when k≥nk \\geq nk≥n, we say:"
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "language": "text",
      "content": "m(m+1)2≥n\\cfrac{m(m + 1)}{2} \\geq n2m(m+1)​≥n"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "To simplify the math, we approximate again by treating this inequality as an equation and ignoring the +1 term and the division for large values of m:"
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "language": "text",
      "content": "⇒m2≈n\\Rightarrow m^2 \\approx n⇒m2≈n⇒m≈n\\Rightarrow m \\approx \\sqrt{n}⇒m≈n​"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "So, the loop runs for about n\\sqrt{n}n​ iterations."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Hence, the time complexity of the program is:"
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "language": "text",
      "content": "O(n)O(\\sqrt{n})O(n​)"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "We used approximations twice — once to simplify the sum of terms, and once to convert an inequality into an equation — so the final time complexity is close to O(n)O(\\sqrt{n})O(n​), not exact."
    },
    {
